# The tools need no API keys.

# Needed by run_area, compare_area and compare_dates: the base URL of your own TerraMind inference service
# (see ../README.md, "Serve TerraMind yourself"). pick_scene uses it only for the service's tile limit.
# TM_API_URL=

# Identifies this server to OpenStreetMap Nominatim (geocode, reverse_geocode). Please set your own.
# NOMINATIM_USER_AGENT=eo-mcp-tools/0.2 (you@example.org)
